WEBVTT

1
00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:05.666
In these verses, Lord Krishna
speaks about those people

2
00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:08.916
who worship the devas as the supreme power.

3
00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:10.083
Such people follow

4
00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:12.083
Vedic rituals,

5
00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:13.875
whose purpose is to attain the

6
00:01:13.875 --> 00:01:16.000
material pleasures of heaven.

7
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.750
Lord Krishna acknowledges

8
00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:19.625
that even the worship of these devas

9
00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:21.208
is indirectly

10
00:01:21.208 --> 00:01:23.625
directed toward Him,

11
00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:26.583
since He is the source of all divinity.

12
00:01:26.583 --> 00:01:29.250
But the ultimate goal of these people,

13
00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:31.250
instead of eternal liberation,

14
00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.750
remains limited to temporary pleasures.

15
00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:42.625
In these verses, Lord Krishna explains

16
00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:43.833
that some people follow

17
00:01:43.833 --> 00:01:45.750
the instructions of the Vedas

18
00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:49.000
and to reach Svarga-loka perform rituals.

19
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.208
These people drink soma-rasa,

20
00:01:52.208 --> 00:01:55.541
the sacred drink used in yajnas.

21
00:01:55.541 --> 00:01:57.750
It purifies them of sins

22
00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.666
and helps them earn punya, or merit.

23
00:02:00.666 --> 00:02:02.125
Their goal is to enjoy

24
00:02:02.125 --> 00:02:04.250
the pleasures of heaven,

25
00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.458
which they consider

26
00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.833
the highest fruit of their actions.

27
00:02:07.833 --> 00:02:10.583
In the coming verses, Lord Krishna will explain

28
00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:13.583
that although these people worship the devas,

29
00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:14.333
still

30
00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:17.666
this worship indirectly reaches Him,

31
00:02:17.666 --> 00:02:18.416
because

32
00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:21.958
all devas draw their power from Him alone.

33
00:02:21.958 --> 00:02:25.583
But since their focus is centred
on material rewards,

34
00:02:25.583 --> 00:02:29.250
their achievements are temporary.

35
00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.000
Lord Krishna tells us that

36
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.333
when their merit is exhausted,

37
00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:34.666
they must leave heaven

38
00:02:34.666 --> 00:02:37.250
and return again to earth.

39
00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:40.166
This endless cycle running between

40
00:02:40.166 --> 00:02:41.541
earth and heaven

41
00:02:41.541 --> 00:02:44.083
keeps them bound to the material world.

42
00:02:44.083 --> 00:02:46.708
Though they perform religious acts

43
00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:48.875
and gain temporary happiness,

44
00:02:48.875 --> 00:02:51.125
still they miss the opportunity

45
00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:54.416
to connect with Lord Krishna and find lasting peace.

46
00:02:54.416 --> 00:02:56.541
Through these verses, Lord Krishna

47
00:02:56.541 --> 00:02:59.083
gently shows the limited

48
00:02:59.083 --> 00:03:01.375
boundaries of material goals,

49
00:03:01.375 --> 00:03:03.125
even when they are attained

50
00:03:03.125 --> 00:03:04.666
through Vedic rituals.

51
00:03:04.666 --> 00:03:06.541
He emphasises

52
00:03:06.541 --> 00:03:09.375
that true fulfilment lies beyond

53
00:03:09.375 --> 00:03:13.625
temporary pleasures –
in the direct search for Him.

54
00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:20.416
In your life,

55
00:03:20.416 --> 00:03:23.958
the happiness, talent, opportunity,

56
00:03:23.958 --> 00:03:27.250
and success that are visible –

57
00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:30.500
these did not come from nowhere.

58
00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:33.541
All of this you have

59
00:03:33.541 --> 00:03:38.000
earned through the actions of your past lives,

60
00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:41.583
and they have come to you today.

61
00:03:41.583 --> 00:03:43.750
This is just like

62
00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.958
someone who

63
00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:49.083
as the fruit of virtuous deeds

64
00:03:49.083 --> 00:03:52.291
reaches Svarga-loka.

65
00:03:52.291 --> 00:03:54.916
But as soon as

66
00:03:54.916 --> 00:03:58.875
their merit is exhausted,

67
00:03:58.875 --> 00:04:03.500
they must return to earth.

68
00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:07.541
Just as in any savings,

69
00:04:07.541 --> 00:04:11.333
if nothing new is deposited,

70
00:04:11.333 --> 00:04:15.833
it slowly becomes empty,

71
00:04:15.833 --> 00:04:20.583
because spending continues all the time.

72
00:04:20.583 --> 00:04:25.208
When this truth is understood from within,

73
00:04:25.208 --> 00:04:29.791
the mind becomes humble on its own,

74
00:04:29.791 --> 00:04:35.000
and pride does not arise that 'I am very capable.'

75
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.916
Nor does that view come

76
00:04:37.916 --> 00:04:42.833
that 'I no longer need to do anything.'

77
00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:44.083
Instead,

78
00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:47.250
a new vision is born.

79
00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:51.625
The feeling that all that I have received

80
00:04:51.625 --> 00:04:56.541
is not eternal, and not entirely

81
00:04:56.541 --> 00:04:59.458
mine either.

82
00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:03.375
Then this realisation comes that for these gifts

83
00:05:03.375 --> 00:05:06.916
I should be grateful

84
00:05:06.916 --> 00:05:09.958
and I should use them well.

85
00:05:09.958 --> 00:05:13.083
Now the question is –

86
00:05:13.083 --> 00:05:17.458
as long as these qualities are with us,

87
00:05:17.458 --> 00:05:20.875
what should we do?

88
00:05:20.875 --> 00:05:23.791
The answer is simple.

89
00:05:23.791 --> 00:05:27.708
Do not keep them only for yourself.

90
00:05:27.708 --> 00:05:29.750
Share them.

91
00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:33.291
With your abilities, be a support for someone.

92
00:05:33.291 --> 00:05:35.750
Guide someone.

93
00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.000
Inspire someone

94
00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.291
to move forward in life,

95
00:05:39.291 --> 00:05:43.083
and most importantly, of your own life

96
00:05:43.083 --> 00:05:47.416
try to understand the deeper meaning,

97
00:05:47.416 --> 00:05:51.166
which is not just between gaining and losing,

98
00:05:51.166 --> 00:05:54.916
but in service, gratitude,

99
00:05:54.916 --> 00:05:59.250
and inner awakening is revealed.

100
00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.375
Life is ever-changing.

101
00:06:01.375 --> 00:06:04.583
With time much may shift,

102
00:06:04.583 --> 00:06:07.708
but what is permanent is

103
00:06:07.708 --> 00:06:10.583
your spirit of service,

104
00:06:10.583 --> 00:06:13.041
your heart full of gratitude,

105
00:06:13.041 --> 00:06:16.125
and that true growth awakening

106
00:06:16.125 --> 00:06:18.625
within your soul.

107
00:06:18.625 --> 00:06:22.500
Let go of ego, embrace gratitude.

108
00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:25.625
Spread love and harmony

109
00:06:25.625 --> 00:06:27.083
far and wide.

110
00:06:31.375 --> 00:06:34.666
In a family, the practice of dharma

111
00:06:34.666 --> 00:06:38.958
often centres around material wellbeing –

112
00:06:38.958 --> 00:06:42.291
giving good education, financial stability,

113
00:06:42.291 --> 00:06:46.291
and a comfortable lifestyle.

114
00:06:46.291 --> 00:06:48.208
But

115
00:06:48.208 --> 00:06:49.875
is this

116
00:06:49.875 --> 00:06:52.833
the complete purpose of dharma?

117
00:06:52.833 --> 00:06:56.666
Although these are important, but

118
00:06:56.666 --> 00:07:00.958
dharma is not just a means to prosperity.

119
00:07:00.958 --> 00:07:03.375
It is a path of spiritual

120
00:07:03.375 --> 00:07:05.250
purification and growth.

121
00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:08.458
In a family, parents

122
00:07:08.458 --> 00:07:11.000
work day and night

123
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.625
to give their children

124
00:07:12.625 --> 00:07:15.750
good education and comforts.

125
00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.583
They have everything –

126
00:07:17.583 --> 00:07:21.291
a big home, good cars, foreign trips.

127
00:07:21.291 --> 00:07:23.958
But

128
00:07:23.958 --> 00:07:26.875
if there is no mutual love, respect,

129
00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:30.375
and spiritual values,

130
00:07:30.375 --> 00:07:34.250
then will any of these material achievements

131
00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.750
have any meaning?

132
00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.458
Not at all.

133
00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:41.333
When families focus only on

134
00:07:41.333 --> 00:07:44.916
material goals,

135
00:07:44.916 --> 00:07:48.500
the results, though attractive,

136
00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.166
are temporary.

137
00:07:51.166 --> 00:07:54.416
Remember, true dharma

138
00:07:54.416 --> 00:07:56.666
teaches us to balance

139
00:07:56.666 --> 00:08:02.291
worldly responsibilities with
life's higher purposes.

140
00:08:02.291 --> 00:08:05.041
As parents, when

141
00:08:05.041 --> 00:08:10.250
you take dharma as a path of spiritual growth

142
00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:13.416
and practise it,

143
00:08:13.416 --> 00:08:17.166
you create such an environment

144
00:08:17.166 --> 00:08:20.875
where every member of the family feels

145
00:08:20.875 --> 00:08:24.750
connected not just to each other, but

146
00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:28.750
also to an eternal spiritual truth

147
00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.458
they are connected.

148
00:08:30.458 --> 00:08:32.833
For your family, do not

149
00:08:32.833 --> 00:08:36.541
strive only for material success,

150
00:08:36.541 --> 00:08:40.791
but with humility and love

151
00:08:40.791 --> 00:08:44.208
bring lasting peace into the family

152
00:08:44.208 --> 00:08:47.541
and inspire everyone toward a

153
00:08:47.541 --> 00:08:49.333
greater purpose.

154
00:08:49.333 --> 00:08:53.333
The truth is not just what you

155
00:08:53.333 --> 00:08:55.208
gain in life.

156
00:08:55.208 --> 00:08:57.250
What matters is

157
00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:59.875
how through this life

158
00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:04.375
you are transformed.

159
00:09:04.375 --> 00:09:07.291
This is a dharmic life's

160
00:09:07.291 --> 00:09:11.166
true essence of living.

161
00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:19.166
In the professional world, success

162
00:09:19.166 --> 00:09:24.125
is usually like a peak

163
00:09:24.125 --> 00:09:28.125
we keep climbing toward, but

164
00:09:28.125 --> 00:09:33.000
can anyone stay at the summit forever?

165
00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:37.750
Just as due to the movement
of the earth, the seasons

166
00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:42.416
keep changing constantly, in the same way

167
00:09:42.416 --> 00:09:46.708
the ups and downs of your professional life

168
00:09:46.708 --> 00:09:49.583
reflect the cosmic cycle

169
00:09:49.583 --> 00:09:52.041
of karma's balance,

170
00:09:52.041 --> 00:09:54.500
where no situation

171
00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:57.041
is permanent.

172
00:09:57.041 --> 00:09:59.458
The person who today leads

173
00:09:59.458 --> 00:10:03.291
an organisation, who is at the top,

174
00:10:03.291 --> 00:10:06.416
tomorrow may have to work

175
00:10:06.416 --> 00:10:09.416
under someone else's leadership.

176
00:10:09.416 --> 00:10:12.500
When you are at the top,

177
00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.333
then remember,

178
00:10:14.333 --> 00:10:18.000
this is not only the result of your own efforts,

179
00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:20.875
but also of past good actions

180
00:10:20.875 --> 00:10:24.041
and good present opportunities –

181
00:10:24.041 --> 00:10:25.500
the result.

182
00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:30.791
Does this awareness bring humility in you?

183
00:10:30.791 --> 00:10:34.708
It does. It certainly does.

184
00:10:34.708 --> 00:10:37.375
Let us think.

185
00:10:37.375 --> 00:10:41.875
How will you use your influence?

186
00:10:41.875 --> 00:10:45.291
For self-serving goals, or

187
00:10:45.291 --> 00:10:50.458
to lift those around you up?

188
00:10:50.458 --> 00:10:51.791
Just as fire

189
00:10:51.791 --> 00:10:53.250
spreads its heat

190
00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:57.166
equally in all directions,

191
00:10:57.166 --> 00:11:00.875
in the same way the warmth of your success

192
00:11:00.875 --> 00:11:04.500
let it reach all around you.

193
00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:08.458
In the same way, when you
find yourself in a difficult

194
00:11:08.458 --> 00:11:12.500
situation, do not be disheartened.

195
00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:15.916
The cycle keeps turning, and with persistence

196
00:11:15.916 --> 00:11:20.166
and patience, your time to rise

197
00:11:20.166 --> 00:11:21.833
comes again.

198
00:11:21.833 --> 00:11:26.875
Keep hope in difficult times,
and in times of success

199
00:11:26.875 --> 00:11:30.708
keep humility.

200
00:11:30.708 --> 00:11:33.291
This understanding fosters

201
00:11:33.291 --> 00:11:36.875
seriousness and grace,

202
00:11:36.875 --> 00:11:38.958
which allows you in the professional

203
00:11:38.958 --> 00:11:42.708
world to move forward with composure,

204
00:11:42.708 --> 00:11:45.958
whether you are soaring high

205
00:11:45.958 --> 00:11:49.166
or facing problems.

206
00:11:49.166 --> 00:11:51.083
Remember,

207
00:11:51.083 --> 00:11:52.583
it is not always

208
00:11:52.583 --> 00:11:55.541
about staying at the top,

209
00:11:55.541 --> 00:11:58.791
but wherever you are,

210
00:11:58.791 --> 00:12:03.458
about staying rooted in the ground of truth.

211
00:12:03.458 --> 00:12:06.125
If you adopt this truth

212
00:12:06.125 --> 00:12:09.208
at your workplace,

213
00:12:09.208 --> 00:12:13.500
then in every situation you will remain in joy.
